    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1229" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδέω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be sated with</i>, c. dat., only in
			aor. and pf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ
				ξεῖνος . . δείπνψ ἁδήσειε</span> lest he <i>should be
				sated with</i> the repast, <i>feel loathing at</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.134
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀηδήσειε</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> καμάτῳ ἁδηκότεσἠδὲκαὶ ὕπνῳ</span>
			<i>sated with</i> toil and sleep, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.98
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				312
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				399
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				471
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.281
			</span></i>; cf.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅδην</span>.</div>
